uture.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_7", "type": "objective"}]}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "will", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 2, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn8le06ob05re6aud10", "type": "audio"}, {"content": "Some people think that students", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "incorrect", "contents": [{"content": "won't", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "not have a balanced life if they don't do other activities.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_7", "type": "objective"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 9, "template_override": 1}, {"type": "TYP", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "How will working affect students?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Read the sentences.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Choose from these words: <span class=\"product-color-text\">qualifications</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">performance</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">combine</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}]}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "qualifications", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "When you go to an interview, you will be asked about your", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": ".", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "performance", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "For some students, working during school will negatively affect their", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": ".", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "combine", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 2, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "To have a balance in life, we need to", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "work and fun.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 10, "template_override": 1}, {"type": "RSLT", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"id": 1, "correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "Working part-time during school has become common with many American high school students. The advantages are clear. Teens make extra spending money, get valuable work experience, learn to manage their time, and meet new people. But what effect does it have on their grades?", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "Recent research suggests that working part-time can have a negative effect on school performance. Students under 18 that work more than 20 hours a week may be less likely to complete school than those who don't. Teens ought to have time for other activities and for family and friends.", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "16000", "id": 2}, {"text": "\u201cClearly, there are both advantages and disadvantages to combining work and school,\u201d said the parent of one working teen. \u201cInterviewing for different positions and working for an employer has been good for my daughter. But there is supposed to be a balance between study, work, and other activities. I want her to be successful in every aspect of her life.\u201d", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img03.jpg", "time": "31000", "id": 3}, {"text": "<p>Others argue that the type of job a teenager chooses is important. \u201cTeenagers should apply for positions that shall give them future career opportunities,\u201d said one expert. \u201cThat way, they learn to do things that will help them later. They get skills and qualifications that will lead them to an interesting, high-paying job in the future.\u201d </p>", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "49700", "id": 4}, {"text": "<p>There had better be longer-term research completed if we are to gain a better understanding of the impact of work on teenagers' overall life performance.</p>", "image": "engenn8le06ob05re2img02.jpg", "time": "67000", "id": 5}], "coverimg": "engenn8le06ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le06ob05re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Tales from the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Working Teens", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's backgrounds in a wider variety  of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Using Modals to Add Meaning", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Modals are called \"helper verbs\" because you use them to help specify meaning of the main verb of a sentence. Modal verbs can add the meanings of advice, strong advice and obligation (among other uses). ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Some examples of modals are: <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of statement or question with a modal verb is: <br> Subject + modal + verb <br> Question word + modal + subject + main verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the following chart with examples of each modal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Should</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Teenagers<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> should apply</span>  for positions that shall give them future career opportunities.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Ought to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Teens<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  ought to have </span> time for other activities and for family and friends.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Had better</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Strong Advice <br/>(Necessity)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There <span class=\\\"strong\\\">  had better be</span>  longer-term research completed.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">There<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'d better be</span>  longer-term research completed. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Supposed to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Obligation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">But there <span class=\\\"strong\\\">  is supposed to be</span>  a balance between study, work, and other activities.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Notice the reduction of <span class=\"italic\">had better</span>. In speaking, it is normally reduced to <span class=\"italic\">\u2018d better</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> have the same meaning, but <span class=\"italic\">should</span> is more common in American English. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future Using <span class=\"italic\">Will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Shall</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">shall</span> to give information about the future or to make predictions (talk about what we think or guess) about the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This is the form you use:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span>/<span class=\"italic\">shall</span> + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">It will be cold tomorrow.<br/>He shall call me next week.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Speakers of North American English rarely use <span class=\"italic\">shall</span> in this way, as it sounds too formal in conversation. It is sometimes used in writing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Teenagers should apply for positions that shall give them future career opportunities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That way, they learn to do things that will help them later.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They get skills and qualifications that will lead them to an interesting, high-paying job in the future.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "spending money", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money available to be spent on pleasures and entertainment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Teens make extra spending money, get valuable work experience, learn to manage their time, and meet new people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about school and work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "grade ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "mark received in school", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: But what effect does work have on their grades?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "performance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "how well a \u200bperson, \u200bmachine, etc. does a \u200bpiece of \u200bwork or an \u200bactivity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Working part-time can have a negative effect on school performance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to combine", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to join together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are both advantages and disadvantages to combining work and school.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "balance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a state where things are of equal importance or force", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is supposed to be a balance between study, work, and other activities. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "aspect", "type": "name"}, {"content": "one part", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want her to be successful in every aspect of her life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "qualification", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an \u200bability, \u200bcharacteristic, or \u200bexperience that makes you \u200bsuitable for a \u200bparticular \u200bjob or \u200bactivity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They get skills and qualifications that will lead them to an interesting job in the future. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "high-paying", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having a high salary", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need skills and qualifications to get a high-paying job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find out how many other students work while studying and how they feel about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write some questions to ask other students about their opinions about the advantages and disadvantages of having a part-time job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Summarize your findings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your information to your group or class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs, work, manners and customs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I should, ought to, had better, or am supposed to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about future action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I survey other students and present information to a group.", "type": "text"}]}]}